#HELPS
-1 "OUTPOST" OUTPOST~
{120}Outpost of {134}Kric'crsk{300} - {110}The {117}Orc{300} {110}Headquarters{300}.


{130}   For eons, scholars of all races and origin, have always stressed that{300} 
{130}in order for us to surpass even ourselves in all aspects of life, we must{300} 
{130}have clear thinking, self awareness, and be void of bias, so that if we{300} 
{130}ever make a judgement or a choice, we will know we did the right thing{300} 
{130}for everyone and including ourselves. However, people are not as clear{300} 
{130}thinking as the scholars thought sentient beings should be. Or that{300} 
{130}having great self awareness so that we can better relate ourselves. Nor{300} 
{130}are we void of bias such that any kind of differences we perceive, we{300} 
{130}will fully understand them. Driven by our own lust, faith, passion and{300} 
{130}hearth, we as sentient beings accelerated towards the unknown; it is this{300} 
{130}unknown that many of us came to love, hate or fear or all of them.{300} 
{130}   Now is the time for you to decide your own fate and the fate of your{300} 
{130}people. Whether you join or not, if you do, whether if you are driven by{300} 
{130}revenge, hope, friendship, love or hate, we do not know for certain. Yet{300} 
{130}we can only hope for the all those who have suffered, who are suffering{300} 
{130}now and will suffer in the future for all the evil things that the{300} 
{130}dwarves had, have and will do to us, we urge you to help us to stop them.{300} 




    {135}(A){300}  {117}Extras... Just a little something{300}.
    {135}(B){300}  {117}Reminders... Hope it helps{300}.





