#2400
Tavern Keeper~
Hozrk~
The tavern keeper is here.~
This orc is medium built and of average height. He wore an apron on him, 
with dirty brown tunic and pants, you don't find anything unusual about 
him. As you enter the tavern, he smile at you broadly and asked you what 
you need.~
