#2414
Ceremonial Guards~
Ceremonial Guard~
A mean looking guard stands here.~
Stands before you is an orc guard that is encased in full armor. At his 
side, he has a huge broadsword sheath in a beautifully made scarab. The 
weird thing about the scarab is that one of the side does not cover the 
sword at all. What is holding the sword in the scarab is a complicated 
looking latch.~
