#2400
Tavern of the Lswd~
The tavern so is dark and gloomy that you can barely see the tables and 
chairs of crude design. You also noticed that most of those furniture you
see here are patched and you guessed that tavern fights probably occurred
frequently here. However, the odd thing about this tavern that there is
no customers at that you can see at all. A waitress who dresses scantily,
is cleaning a table, even though there's nothing to clean(if you ever
can clean this place up at all). A scruffy and none too clean looking
bartender lean against the counter. As when you entered, he looked at
you disdainfully.~
