imagine what this place has to sell. As much as you hate it, you do have 
to admit that living things like yourself do die one way or the other. 
After some time as your eyes adjust to the near darkness of this cave, you 
finally noticed that the cave floor litters with bones and even rotten 
body parts. It is when you gasp in astonishment, that a medium built orc 
