races. The ceiling is obviously enlarged, and made to look roughly like a 
dome. This you can tell by the markings of tools found on the ceiling that 
you can barely see. Only a few torches can be found in this dome that 
barely light this place. Interesting enough, next to each torch, there is 
a banner that contain designs that you cannot identify. They are probably 
war banners of rival tribes that had been vanquished. Directly in the 
center of the ceiling of the dome is a spiral stairways that leads both up 
and down this dome. Four miniature underground springs are found in this 
dome with benches placed next to them.~
