#2413
Cave of History~
As you walk along the spiral stairs that connects this sizable cave with 
other caves and caverns system, you feel like as if you're walking 
through history. The cave walls are painfully polished and art depicting the
struggles between the dwarves and the orcs. For ages, the dwarves have 
claim both race and cultural superiority over the orcs. The dwarves 
first started the slow but steady ethnocide and genocide of the orcs. Our 
caves are taken away from us and home are raided constantly. The dwarves 
kills orcs for sport, and for fun. Many have suffered and even died 
needlessly, all due to the dwarves' crimes against orckind. The first 
large scale resistance against the murderous dwarves are lead by Chief Bwrak,
of the clan Hellsfire. The battle was long and ugly and loses were great. 
Finally, after forty nine days of struggle against the oppressors, Chief 
Bwrak and the various clans united under one banner won the decisive 
battle. That day was a the first day that the orckind can live as free 
people; free from total annihilation and destruction of our culture. 
Now we urge you sons and daughters of orckind, to defend what your 
forefathers have fought and bleed for. Only you can prevent us from being
oppressed by savages who do not have honor, justice and understanding 
of the rudimentary rights of living beings.~
