Restroom~
This is the women's restroom. Everything here are polished up to the 
point where the reflection of any light source hurts the eyes. Orc made 
running underground water is available, and the lion head faucet 
constantly supplies fresh and clean water. There is also a sub complex 
connected to this restroom, that is loaded with state of the art bathing 
facilities and a huge hot spring is also situated there.~
